":"a","feedback":{"correct_en":"手のひらを返す is the idiom for abruptly reversing one's attitude (like flipping a palm). Perfectly fits Natsumi's accusation.","incorrect_en":"目玉を返す and 背中を返す aren't idioms for attitude change.","contrast_examples":[{"jp":"手のひらを返したような態度。","en":"A complete reversal of attitude."},{"jp":"手のひらに乗せる。","en":"Place on the palm. (literal)"}]},"difficulty":"medium","estimated_seconds":18,"audio":{"replay_available":true,"sentence_ids":["ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01-ch007-0443"],"start":1713.048,"end":1719.696},"weak_point_refs":[],"source_type":"ai_story","book_id":"ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01","chapter_id":"ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01-ch007","response_mode":"single_choice","generation_method":"generated_from_ai_story","validation_status":"pass","node_id":"ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01-ch007-int-0024"},{"source_sentence_ids":["ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01-ch007-0209"],"interaction_type":"cloze_choice","focus_tags":["vocabulary.verb_choice"],"prompt":{"context_jp":"適度に空気を ___ のが 目的なんです","prompt_jp":"適度に空気を ___ のが 目的なんです","prompt_en":"Choose the verb meaning 'to incorporate (air)'."},"choices":[{"choice_id":"a","text":"含ませる"},{"choice_id":"b","text":"入れる"},{"choice_id":"c","text":"吸う"}],"correct_choice_id":"a","feedback":{"correct_en":"含ませる (to make something contain/absorb) is the technical/standard verb for incorporating air into batter.","incorrect_en":"入れる is too general and less natural here. 吸う (to inhale/suck) doesn't fit batter-mixing.","contrast_examples":[{"jp":"生地に空気を含ませる。","en":"Incorporate air into the batter."},{"jp":"箱に物を入れる。","en":"Put things in a box."}]},"difficulty":"medium","estimated_seconds":18,"audio":{"replay_available":true,"sentence_ids":["ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekkon-dekinai-otoko-ai-s01-ch007-0209"],"start":829.032,"end":839.496},"weak_point_refs":[],"source_type":"ai_story","book_id":"ai-ai-augmented-dramas-kekko